  "answer_text": "**Lucas Adams** currently plays Noah Newman on *The Young and the Restless*. He joined the show in November 2025 as Noah, the son of Sharon (Sharon Case) and Nick Newman (Joshua Morrow).\n\nAdams is best known for previously playing Dr. Tripp Dalton Johnson on *Days of Our Lives*. He was nominated for a Daytime Emmy Award for Outstanding Younger Actor in a Drama Series for that role in 2018 and 2019.\n\nThe role of Noah Newman has been played by several actors over the years:\n- **Kevin Schmidt** was the first actor to play Noah after the character was aged, appearing from 2008 to September 2010. The role was then recast with **Luke Kleintank** before Schmidt was rehired, and then let go again in 2012, replaced by **Robert Adamson**, who held the role until 2018.\n- **Rory Gibson** debuted in the role in 2021 and made his last appearance in April 2023, when Noah left Genoa City and moved to London.\n- The character returned in 2025 with **Lucas Adams** assuming the role.",
